{"id":"00055","root":"uni00055_1","name":{"ja":"ブリジット","en":"Brigitte"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ブリジット","en":"Brigitte"},"aliases":["Bridget"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-10-05","limited":false,"characterId":48,"profile":{"ja":"狐の獣人。人間界では妖狐と呼ばれている。魔界にある氷雪地帯に生息している獣人族の一部族。見た目は少女で耳は頭の上にあり尖がっており、お尻にはふわふわの尻尾がはえている。狩りを好み、警戒心が強いが人間界の狐と同じで人や魔族に慣れてしまえば犬猫のように懐いてしまう。ブリジットは狐族の族長の娘で無邪気で幼いながらひょいひょい色々なところに行ってはいろんな経験を積み、狩りをしては土産を持って帰ってくる。最近では魔界での狩りに飽きてしまい人間界に行って色々と学んでいる。戦闘の時は人型から巨大な獣型に変化し相手をかみ殺す。人型でも戦闘は可能だが普通の人間に毛がはえたくらいの強さである。","en":"Brigitte is a fox beast-person. In the Human Realm she's called a \"yōko.\" She belongs to a tribe of beast-people that inhabits the icy snowfields of the Demon Realm. She looks like a girl, with pointed ears atop her head and a fluffy tail on her rear. She loves hunting and is very wary, but like foxes in the Human Realm, once she gets used to people or demons she becomes as affectionate as a dog or cat. Brigitte is the daughter of the fox tribe's chieftain; though innocent and childlike, she darts about, gaining all sorts of experience, and brings back trophies from her hunts. Lately she's grown bored of hunting in the Demon Realm and has been traveling to the Human Realm to learn new things. In battle she can transform from human form into a gigantic beast form to bite her foes to death. Even in human form she can fight, possessing strength roughly equivalent to a normal human covered in fur."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"星空ユメ","forms":[{"id":"uni00055_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1048,2096],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[108,216],"def":[132,264],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","20001"]},{"id":"uni00055_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1596,3192],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[151,302],"def":[199,398],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","20001","20002"]},{"id":"uni00055_3","rarity":